WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Upload your resume PDF to Interview Trix ATS Checker and optionally paste a target job description.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
The system parses your document and measures ATS parse rate across sections and formatting.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Your Smart ATS Score appears with a breakdown across content, sections, and essentials.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Content checks flag weak bullets, missing metrics, grammar issues, and repetition.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Section analysis verifies contact details, essential headings, and recruiter-friendly order.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:00.000
ATS essentials catch file format risks, design problems, and header link issues.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:10.000
HR red flags and seniority signals highlight credibility gaps and level-fit concerns.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Tailoring checks compare hard skills, soft skills, and title match against the job description.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:30.000
Each issue includes clear guidance so you know exactly what to fix before applying.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:40.000
Jump into the AI resume builder to rewrite flagged sections with stronger keywords.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:50.000
Live scoring updates as you edit — watch your ATS score climb in real time.

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:58.000
Export an optimized, shortlist-ready resume built to pass bots and impress recruiters.
